Show custom styles:
{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Calibri;}}
{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2510;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs22 The Citavi Add-In can detect which chapter of your document you are working on and automatically show you the matching references and quotations in your Citavi project. \par
To begin, insert your Citavi category into your document as a heading: on the \b References\b0  or \b Knowledge\b0  tab, simply double-click a category to insert it.\par
}

显示自定义样式:
{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Calibri;}}
{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2510;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs22 Citavi 加载项可以检测您正在处理文档的哪一章节，并自动在您的 Citavi 项目中显示匹配的文献和引文。 \par
首先，将您的 Citavi 分类作为标题插入到文档中：在 \b 文献\b0  或 \b 知识\b0  选项卡上，只需双击分类即可插入。\par
}

Show custom styles:
{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Calibri;}}
{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2510;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs22 This tab shows you the references in the current project. Click the \b View \b0 menu to change view options. \par
Double-click a reference to insert it.\par
To insert a multiple citation, insert the first citation, then place the cursor in the citation and double-click the second reference to insert it.\par
}

显示自定义样式:
{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Calibri;}}
{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2510;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\lang9\f0\fs22 此选项卡显示当前项目中的文献。单击 \b 视图 \b0 菜单可更改视图选项。 \par
双击文献即可插入。\par
要插入多重引文，请先插入第一条引文，然后将光标置于该引文中，并双击第二条文献将其插入。\par
}

